{"availability":"available","full":"AlejandroDukesini/Personal_Task_Gestor","name":"Personal_Task_Gestor","description":"Sitio web desarrollado en local para la gestión de tareas, trabajos y actividades. Fusiona Cashew, Ticktick, bloc de notas, calendario con conexión a Google calendar.","category":"Productivity","language":"TypeScript","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-06-08T16:38:36Z","updated":"2026-10-09T15:10:01Z","branch":"Principal","homepage":"https://task-gestor.netlify.app/","topics":[],"demo":"https://task-gestor.netlify.app/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T11:07:59.524Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T11:07:59.524Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T11:07:59.524Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T11:07:59.524Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Tareas · Hábitos · Calendario · Objetivos · Finanzas · Notas","Local-First: tus datos viven en tu dispositivo, funcionan sin conexión y se sincronizan solo cuando tú lo decides.","Una plataforma modular de productividad personal al estilo Notion + Todoist + Google Calendar + Habit Tracker, con gestión financiera y notas integradas. Está diseñada bajo el concepto Local-First: no hay cuentas, ni servidores en la nube, ni telemetría. Toda la información se guarda en el navegador (IndexedDB) o en la app de escritorio, lo que garantiza privacidad, rapidez y funcionamiento completo sin conexión."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/AlejandroDukesini/Personal_Task_Gestor/blob/Principal/README.md","fingerprint":"17d73254e86d24608adb6db9a22c055f2fa26969778d2c75a10815ffe7d8443d","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T11:07:59.590Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T11:07:59.590Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Tareas · Hábitos · Calendario · Objetivos · Finanzas · Notas","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/AlejandroDukesini/Personal_Task_Gestor/blob/Principal/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"17d73254e8